The '''office of the Magistrate of Nevarro''' was the personal office<ref name="The Mythrol">{{Databank|the-mythrol|The Mythrol}}</ref> of [[Greef Karga]], the person who held the role of [[High Magistrate]]<ref name="Key Art">{{SW|url=news/the-mandalorian-season-3-trailer-key-art|text=The Mandalorian Soars in New Season 3 Trailer and Key Art}}</ref> of [[Nevarro]]. "[[The Fledgling Mythrol|The Mythrol]]" also worked out of the office.<ref name="Chapter 12" />

